This is a repository that contains everything of E-comOS!
All code (excluding documentation) is included in the form of submodules.
This repository does not use a unified license; instead, all licenses are placed
in the `LICENSE` folder for unified viewing. The license names of each reposito-
ry are similar:
	<repo name>.lincense (<.txt/.rtf>)
All code is put in the `source` folder.
About documentation we use GNU FDL Version 1.3 or later (see COPYING.DOC) , you 
can see our documents in `docs` folder.

For developers of documents fix:
	Read `docs/getting-started.DOCS` file, then `git add` your fix , and `git commit` to say what do you changed. After that please `git format-patch` to create a new patch file , at last to send your patch file (via `git send-email` or your e-mail software ) to e-comos-kernel@groups.io
	NOTE: ABOUT `WHY EMAIL ADDRESS IS `e-comos-kernel@groups.io`:
		Because our team is small , don't need to more mailing list for develop. This is a history problem.

Thank you very much.
